# No API keys required.
#
# In-studio image generation runs through the Higgsfield CLI, which holds its
# own login:
#
#   npm install -g @higgsfield/cli
#   higgsfield auth login
#
# Everything below is optional.

# Override the text-to-image job type the studio asks the CLI for.
# Run `higgsfield model list --image` to see what your account can use.
# HIGGSFIELD_MODEL=nano_banana_flash          # nano_banana_flash IS Nano Banana 2

# Output size asked of the model. Defaults to 2k; 4k costs more credits.
# HIGGSFIELD_RESOLUTION=4k
